{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Dive in to the hyper lust cyberpunk future with the mercenary, Zoey.\u00a0 Get your freak on by exploring the lascivious Neon City or navigate tactically with gadgets and wits. There are many dark secrets waiting to be found. Will you thrive in the Neon Nights?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/steam_titles_1.png?t=1743671088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/AD_4nXcLQofbrz7a_hq651leLC-Z5cLC1hY1O_K6PCDLEZKtMPdg84T2iTqoVpNlCxHycVkYDQHfYnf6hgmnmCwL-04Gh9aobUcwiTtkhwkMpAlgDBOTL2fL6VqWxI1K0olKTij_OZCV.gif?t=1743671088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Third Crisis: Neon Nights offers a brand new and improved art style, with an animation system that adapts to how you play the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/steam_titles_tcnn_2.png?t=1743671088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/AD_4nXchpV2b_F6H9cTzKtGJGLa0Re_ZI97X9WlG94VIHvY1WjIeduW_O4wf7Vr57-T3XiK6v8e2MzD-WC8dwOuUX3JmpfD22ymCFJC0lpb1Ky62M9ScFxY0ew5VJsXc9x0pdzrYbMVcNw.gif?t=1743671088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zoey will be whoever you want her to be.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/steam_titles_tcnn_3.png?t=1743671088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/AD_4nXeHW2DEx4U0aSPHZImfEJhdCIGVOtFUE9pVYEbDQu2ex8H0gePPLrc0lpVeksDQOwEgkxtLxhIhQCtAlwOCUkH0AXiYahmzAxlj2La0xrLEysocvM3HXKPsH1uL1TGbOHjR6ET5vg.gif?t=1743671088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Stealth is part of any good cyberpunk adventure, and here it's no different: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take advantage of your surroundings and situational awareness, and be rewarded for it; in more ways than the material. Become the ultimate infiltrator you always wanted to be, or indulge in the thrill of the chase.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/steam_titles_tcnn_4.png?t=1743671088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/AD_4nXdfwzFyVd5PZ8IuMT6m8VatkdE4phXexrjE7RSFDhBco_plqgpKJJx5LHLQobbfQjc-GkNjKi87oluK0G3i-iv8OsukHMil8yQJfVNMsEz2tWdAk5CI_sDwzAV_Dym4cZncpITfKg.gif?t=1743671088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make use of your high end optical supplement to identify key targets, and information about the area they are located in. Your camera can even tell you if there's a distinct lack of clothed individuals in the area.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/steam_titles_tcnn_5.png?t=1743671088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/AD_4nXe-trwtPJFWwZXUGK8qQDEs0VR0zpal-lsVmZ-_TTKkTaQeYDX3SRXwniiW-OHesiOemiNt64fwIrdXLHR4H_OVcaRvaVe7z8SKapO0iuEyJgAeAztCoITZRYaqnhaE63WT7CjloA.gif?t=1743671088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We listened to your feedback and toned down the combat this time around. Expect some new challenges, quirks and sights to keep you on your toes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/steam_titles_tcnn_6.png?t=1743671088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/AD_4nXe0KzbNstPCHhR9Fn2x0_veIuZ5byCfgCroyJEKVcpZh0eigRzQYRZuxZ-cWLE9Ffxa-dx4mRKogYKL8chwj6J3wnmHfXlRVXPeU1o47Hdtr5W9gscdmVn9qfrFMuOVC90_tdT7.gif?t=1743671088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep an eye on your neural interface, it will give you valuable information about your journey so far in Neon City. Can you break the perversion levels?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>HELP SHAPE THE FUTURE</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Participate in the inception of a new age of Third Crisis. Your feedback and support will help shape a new experience that will satisfy your cyber(s)punk obsession.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3400350?t=1743671088","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743671088","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/8ae34dc3fd6e46e92e9a55ece9d32af3a0aae5b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743671088","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/8ae34dc3fd6e46e92e9a55ece9d32af3a0aae5b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743671088","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Third Crisis Neon Nights is a game taking place in a lewd world and focuses on showing explicit sexual acts."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Dive in to the hyper lust cyberpunk future with the mercenary, Zoey.\u00a0 Get your freak on by exploring the lascivious Neon City or navigate tactically with gadgets and wits. There are many dark secrets waiting to be found. Will you thrive in the Neon Nights?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/steam_titles_1.png?t=1743671088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/AD_4nXcLQofbrz7a_hq651leLC-Z5cLC1hY1O_K6PCDLEZKtMPdg84T2iTqoVpNlCxHycVkYDQHfYnf6hgmnmCwL-04Gh9aobUcwiTtkhwkMpAlgDBOTL2fL6VqWxI1K0olKTij_OZCV.gif?t=1743671088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Third Crisis: Neon Nights offers a brand new and improved art style, with an animation system that adapts to how you play the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/steam_titles_tcnn_2.png?t=1743671088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/AD_4nXchpV2b_F6H9cTzKtGJGLa0Re_ZI97X9WlG94VIHvY1WjIeduW_O4wf7Vr57-T3XiK6v8e2MzD-WC8dwOuUX3JmpfD22ymCFJC0lpb1Ky62M9ScFxY0ew5VJsXc9x0pdzrYbMVcNw.gif?t=1743671088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zoey will be whoever you want her to be.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/steam_titles_tcnn_3.png?t=1743671088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/AD_4nXeHW2DEx4U0aSPHZImfEJhdCIGVOtFUE9pVYEbDQu2ex8H0gePPLrc0lpVeksDQOwEgkxtLxhIhQCtAlwOCUkH0AXiYahmzAxlj2La0xrLEysocvM3HXKPsH1uL1TGbOHjR6ET5vg.gif?t=1743671088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Stealth is part of any good cyberpunk adventure, and here it's no different: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take advantage of your surroundings and situational awareness, and be rewarded for it; in more ways than the material. Become the ultimate infiltrator you always wanted to be, or indulge in the thrill of the chase.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/steam_titles_tcnn_4.png?t=1743671088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/AD_4nXdfwzFyVd5PZ8IuMT6m8VatkdE4phXexrjE7RSFDhBco_plqgpKJJx5LHLQobbfQjc-GkNjKi87oluK0G3i-iv8OsukHMil8yQJfVNMsEz2tWdAk5CI_sDwzAV_Dym4cZncpITfKg.gif?t=1743671088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make use of your high end optical supplement to identify key targets, and information about the area they are located in. Your camera can even tell you if there's a distinct lack of clothed individuals in the area.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/steam_titles_tcnn_5.png?t=1743671088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/AD_4nXe-trwtPJFWwZXUGK8qQDEs0VR0zpal-lsVmZ-_TTKkTaQeYDX3SRXwniiW-OHesiOemiNt64fwIrdXLHR4H_OVcaRvaVe7z8SKapO0iuEyJgAeAztCoITZRYaqnhaE63WT7CjloA.gif?t=1743671088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We listened to your feedback and toned down the combat this time around. Expect some new challenges, quirks and sights to keep you on your toes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/steam_titles_tcnn_6.png?t=1743671088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/AD_4nXe0KzbNstPCHhR9Fn2x0_veIuZ5byCfgCroyJEKVcpZh0eigRzQYRZuxZ-cWLE9Ffxa-dx4mRKogYKL8chwj6J3wnmHfXlRVXPeU1o47Hdtr5W9gscdmVn9qfrFMuOVC90_tdT7.gif?t=1743671088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep an eye on your neural interface, it will give you valuable information about your journey so far in Neon City. Can you break the perversion levels?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>HELP SHAPE THE FUTURE</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Participate in the inception of a new age of Third Crisis. Your feedback and support will help shape a new experience that will satisfy your cyber(s)punk obsession.</p>","developers":["Anduo Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/header.jpg?t=1743671088","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257090504,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257090504/movie480.mp4?t=1743671086","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257090504/movie_max.mp4?t=1743671086"},"name":"Third Crisis: Neon Nights 0.1 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257090504/655b815c40c997dff5a822e215f9c95b99ec6103/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743671086","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257090504/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743671086","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257090504/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743671086"}}],"name":"Third Crisis: Neon Nights","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Me